    "Corrected source authority is a round inner opening with thin upper casting and a broad continuous curved lower casting; the earlier gothic-apex interpretation remains documented as historical diagnostic work.",
    "All sixteen actual phone originals show the continuous tapered metal ring, concentrated bright neon over deep sapphire or the selected sport palette, and a full refracting gem Enter control instead of the rejected dark metal mesh.",
    "Actual NRL chrome retains neutral highlights without the previous pink lower-metal reflection. NBA remains split blue/red; NRL emerald and UFC ruby retain their own colour systems.",
    "Both phone widths retain crisp proportional logos, visible native Enter text, full gem coverage, independent selector hues and no repeated sport labels or Preview only text.",
    "The sixteen original PNG files independently retain all five navigation labels; raw native-pixel OCR proves preview omissions were image-tool display artefacts.",
    "Native unpaused motion frames advance with real paint; both endcap reflections actually become visible while clipped away from the Enter label. Reduced motion and route inactivity safeguards pass without added timers or app/data substitutions.",
    "All four sport selections, unavailable destination guards, keyboard focus and session restoration, More, NFL entry, existing NFL/Team/Matchup tabs, five direct route loads and exact-body HTTP 200 refreshes pass in both engines.",
    "All 209 protected non-Home runtime files, native Home controller and lifecycle, 56 native markup control contracts, five source JSON books, entire non-Home HTML suffix and fifteen original tests remain byte-identical to the independently recorded baseline."
